  "body": "Positioned on a large 728m² freehold corner site, Lot 25 offers an exceptional opportunity within Hobbs Bay Estate. Elevated to capture expansive views across the Hauraki Harbour, this is a site that delivers both outlook and presence.\r\n\r\nLocated directly opposite a reserve, you’ll enjoy a heightened sense of space, privacy, and openness - while still being just a few minutes’ walk from the beach for effortless coastal living.\r\n\r\nWith its premium positioning and impressive outlooks, Lot 25 provides the perfect foundation to design a standout home in one of Auckland’s most exciting coastal communities.\r\n\r\nLocated in the heart of Gulf Harbour, Hobbs Bay Estate is a brand-new coastal development by Hopper Developments that redefines premium coastal living in Auckland. Currently under development, this exclusive community offers a blend of natural beauty, modern design, and lifestyle convenience. With 88 generously sized sections ranging from 700m² to 2000m², including waterfront and elevated sea-view sites, and only minutes from the Gulf Harbour Marina, nearby retail, and a direct ferry link to Auckland’s CBD, it offers an enviable balance of coastal elegance and urban accessibility.",
